  // proportion to their absolute learning progress (ALP: |mean of its last two competences - mean of the two before|;
  // over fewer attempts, the last one against the one before, the very first against nothing), with ε = 0.2 of pure
  // chance: what it has mastered and what it cannot do fade out by themselves, and it goes back where it progresses.
